// The Velati journal for the systems engine test. Runs at the end of the book on a copy of
// the state; its paragraphs become one journal entry. No choices allowed.
@chapter etc_journal
@title Velati Journal: Engine Test
@book engine-test-c
@version 1

# start
## From the Velati archive, a test entry
> The watchers record what the man of the hill has done.
?if owns("rome.wine")
  He trades in wine now, under the name {collis()}.
?end
?if in_circle("et_fledgling")
  He has given the Dark Gift. We count one more of them.
?else
  We know of no one he has turned.
?end
?if romance_ending("et_love") == "parted"
  The one he loved walked away from him, and lives.
?end
=> endbook
